# Transcribed from a VGM register log by python/vgm_transcribe.py.
# 50 notes and 0 vibrato spans over 3.5s; the grid fits 86% of the
# onsets at 124.5 ms per row.
# Vibrato is recovered with its measured depth and speed.
# Portamento and volume ramps are not recovered, and which drum
# a DAC hit was is not recoverable from a register log at all.
# chipgen tracker  (120.48 BPM, 4 rows/beat)
title 24 - 1-up
bpm 120.48
lpb 4
inst fm0 24___1_up_01
inst fm1 24___1_up_03
inst fm2 24___1_up_02
inst fm3 24___1_up_01
inst fm4 24___1_up_02
cols fm0 fm1 fm2 fm3 fm4 psg0 dac

